# Canonical line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# The local byte-exact guards (the CLI source pin and the golden-set byte
# check) fail on a CRLF worktree, and `core.autocrlf` checkouts can produce
# one — observed when the wave merges rewrote the worktree. This file makes
# LF the single canonical form on every platform.
#
# Binary files are auto-detected and never converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
